<title>USA: N.Y. metal futures opening forecasts.</title>
<headline>N.Y. metal futures opening forecasts.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>New York metals futures were called to open on Monday by traders as follows:</p>
<p>COMEX August gold - unchanged to down 50 cents an ounce</p>
<p>COMEX July silver - up 1.00 to 2.00 cents an ounce</p>
<p>NYMEX July platinum - unchanged to up 50 cents an ounce</p>
<p>NYMEX Sept palladium - unchanged to up 50 cents an ounce</p>
<p>COMEX July copper -  down 0.50 to 1.00 cent per lb</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1640))</p>
</text>
